---
title: "liquidation_inner (Pebble Protocol: Market Internal)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_repay: assert available_repay_coin.value() != 0
    q_check_repay --> q_get_old_debt: old_borrow_amount = obligation.debt(debt_name).unsafe_debt_amount()
    q_get_old_debt --> q_refresh: refresh_obligation_assets_interest(all debts + collaterals)
    q_refresh --> q_ensure_allowed: ensure_liquidate_borrow_allowed(params, obligation, emode, reserves, ...)
    q_ensure_allowed --> q_cap_repay: cap repay to obligation_latest_borrow_amount if needed
    q_cap_repay --> q_calc_seize: liquidate_calculate_seize_ctokens(exchange_rate, incentive, repay, oracle, ...)
    q_calc_seize --> q_check_ctokens: total_ctokens < seized_ctokens?
    q_check_ctokens --> q_adjust: adjust seized_ctokens = total_ctokens, refund excess
    q_check_ctokens --> q_no_adjust: proceed with seized_ctokens
    q_adjust --> q_repay_debt: obligation.unsafe_repay_debt_only(repay.value())
    q_no_adjust --> q_repay_debt
    q_repay_debt --> q_seize: obligation.withdraw_ctokens(seized_ctokens)
    q_seize --> q_liquidate_ctokens: reserve.liquidate_ctokens(ctoken, revenue_factor)
    q_liquidate_ctokens --> q_update_emode: emode_group.update_asset_borrow(old, new)
    q_update_emode --> q_repay_reserve: debt_reserve.repay_amount(repay_coin)
    q_repay_reserve --> q_stop_adl: try_stop deleverage for borrow and collateral
    q_stop_adl --> [*]: return (collateral_coin, refund_coins, ctoken_amount)

    note right of q_ensure_allowed
        INV-001: weighted_debts_value must exceed weighted_collateral_value (or LTV override)
        INV-002: close_factor enforced unless near bad debt (collateral <= 101% * debts)
        INV-003: close_factor bypassed if debt value <= close_factor_bypass_min_value
    end note

    note right of q_liquidate_ctokens
        INV-004: protocol_seize = revenue_factor * redeem_amount
        INV-005: liquidator_seize = redeem_amount - protocol_seize
        INV-006: protocol_seize added to cash_reserve
        INV-007: seize_ctokens = (repay * (1 + incentive) * price_debt) / (price_collateral * exchange_rate)
    end note
